 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the tangent bundle of g at scale r: the total vertices are the rays of \
length r, projected to their first vertex, two rays adjacent iff at every \
position their vertices are equal or adjacent.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"779ccf52-4a4f-4c75-876f-222d5570e872"]
}, Open  ]],

